        </item>
        <item>
          <p>
            <gui>Show flat review contents</gui>: Opens the entire
            review content in a text window. Unbound by default.
          </p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>
            <gui>Copy the contents under flat review to the clipboard</gui>: Copies the last
            text presented by flat review to the clipboard. Works while flat review is active
            and does not require text selection in the application. See "<link xref="features_clipboard">Clipboard</link>" for the
            requirements for reliable clipboard access on Wayland. Unbound by default.
          </p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>
            <gui>Append the contents under flat review to the clipboard</gui>: Adds the last text
            presented by flat review to the clipboard's existing text. Works while flat review
            is active and does not require text selection in the application. See "<link xref="features_clipboard">Clipboard</link>" for the
            requirements for reliable clipboard access on Wayland. Unbound by default.
          </p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>
            <gui>Speak entire window using flat review</gui>
          </p>
